WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.302
You worked at Fox for sixteen years.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.204
What do you make of the fact

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.438
that Fox viewers

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.740
won't hear

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.975
a retraction or an apology outright?

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.211
I consider this a win for Fox.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.712
I consider considered a win for Dominion.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:13.513
As he just said,

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.015
they get a lot of money

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.816
and it helps their checkbook.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:17.484
I don't know that

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.551
it helps their reputation

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.719
because if they

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.688
if Fox never has to make a correction

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.956
or a retraction,

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.991
how is it going to help their reputation?

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:25.892
When they were

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.293
disseminating disinformation

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.728
to Fox viewers?

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.462
So now they're not going

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.264
to make a correction on air to Fox News.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.266
So I'm not sure how it's going to help

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.834
Dominion's reputation,

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.669
but I think that it's a win for Fox.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.571
The fact that Fox doesn't have to take

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:39.005
he kept saying

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.273
they have to take accountability.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.075
They're not doing that publicly on air.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.677
This statement is most weak source.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.780
I hope that they find

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.415
that there are certain claims

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.015
they don't have

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.517
Fox made the claim,

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:52.652
certain claims to be false.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.521
They're not saying that they lied.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.455
They're saying to be false.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:57.390
Sometimes false statements are made

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.925
that that's not intentional.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.393
There's a difference between false

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.294
and knowingly.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.929
Right. Which is the standard. Exactly.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:03.463
My colleague

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.130
Jim Rutenberg

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.598
at the Times reported earlier.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:06.366
I'm just reading it here

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.101
that under the terms of the settlement,

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.170
Fox News will not have to apologize

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.604
