00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:15.542
So that gets exactly

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.310
what Alisyn is talking about.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.078
I'm sure Fox sees

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.179
