by which Fox does not have to

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:44.904
admit wrongdoing,

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.972
then I'm not really sure what they did

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:46.906
other than get a lot of money

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.908
and a lot of money is is is something.

